                                   INCLUDE=
 
Adds the lines of another configuration block at this point.

\bSyntax\p

    INCLUDE=blockname

\bParameters\p

blockname
    A block in CONFIG.SYS, named without the brackets.  [menu] and
    [common] cannot be included.

An included block can include another.  A block that would end up
including itself is reported, and that INCLUDE= line is skipped.

\bRelated Commands\p

See <\aMultiple Configurations\vMulti-config\v>.
 
