                             INSTALL=ÄÄNotes
 
\bWhen it runs\p

INSTALL= lines run last after every DEVICE= line has completed.

\bA program that extends the BIOS\p

A TSR that extends the BIOS, such as a printer redirector or a VBE
driver, has to be loaded with INStALL=.
 
