                                  LASTDRIVE=
 
Sets the highest drive letter programs should look for.

\bSyntax\p

    LASTDRIVE=x

\bParameters\p

x
    A letter, up to P.  LASTDRIVE never goes below the drives the
    machine has, and adds none.  Default setting makes every letter
    available.

\bRelated Commands\p

<\aMOUNT\vMOUNT\v> takes the free letters.
 
                                     
