                                   NUMLOCK=
 
Turns Num Lock on or off at startup.

\bSyntax\p

    NUMLOCK=ON | OFF

Default setting is the state passed by the BIOS.

In a [menu] block, or above the first block, the line takes effect
before the startup menu appears, so it decides whether the keypad
moves the highlight or types a number.
 
